"<main id=\"main-content\" tabindex=\"-1\"><section class=\"ch\" id=\"ch2\">\n\n<p class=\"lead rv\"><span class=\"i18n-text\" data-i18n-en=\"Five Common Retrieval Capabilities in Enterprise RAG\" data-i18n-zh=\"企业 RAG 常见的五种检索能力\">企业 RAG 常见的五种检索能力</span><strong><span class=\"i18n-text\" data-i18n-en=\"They are not substitutes for one another; they solve different problems\" data-i18n-zh=\"不是互相替代，而是解决不同问题\">不是互相替代，而是解决不同问题</span></strong><span class=\"i18n-text\" data-i18n-en=\": identifiers, terminology, semantics, relationships, and scope.\" data-i18n-zh=\"：标识符、术语、语义、关系、范围。\">：标识符、术语、语义、关系、范围。</span></p>\n<div class=\"grid g5 rv\">\n<div class=\"cd\" id=\"retrieval-0\"><div class=\"cd-h\"><span class=\"ic\">EXACT</span></div><small><span class=\"i18n-text\" data-i18n-en=\"For structured fields / normalized strings, use\" data-i18n-zh=\"对结构化字段 / 规范化字符串做\">对结构化字段 / 规范化字符串做</span><strong><span class=\"i18n-text\" data-i18n-en=\"deterministic matching\" data-i18n-zh=\"确定性匹配\">确定性匹配</span></strong>。keyword field、term query、PK lookup、hash、alias。</small><div class=\"lb\"><span class=\"i18n-text\" data-i18n-en=\"Suitable for\" data-i18n-zh=\"适合\">适合</span></div><small><span class=\"i18n-text\" data-i18n-en=\"order IDs · error codes · part numbers · VIN · SKU · API names · version numbers\" data-i18n-zh=\"订单号 · 错误码 · 零件号 · VIN · SKU · API 名 · 版本号\">订单号 · 错误码 · 零件号 · VIN · SKU · API 名 · 版本号</span></small></div>\n<div class=\"cd\" id=\"retrieval-1\"><div class=\"cd-h\"><span class=\"ic\">BM25</span></div><small><span class=\"i18n-text\" data-i18n-en=\"Inverted index,\" data-i18n-zh=\"倒排索引，\">倒排索引，</span><strong><span class=\"i18n-text\" data-i18n-en=\"lexical relevance\" data-i18n-zh=\"词法相关性\">词法相关性</span></strong><span class=\"i18n-text\" data-i18n-en=\"Ranking by term frequency, rarity, and document length.\" data-i18n-zh=\"排序：词频、稀有度、文档长度。\">排序：词频、稀有度、文档长度。</span></small><div class=\"lb\"><span class=\"i18n-text\" data-i18n-en=\"Suitable for\" data-i18n-zh=\"适合\">适合</span></div><small><span class=\"i18n-text\" data-i18n-en=\"domain terms · product names · error descriptions · technical / API / regulatory documents · function names\" data-i18n-zh=\"专业术语 · 产品名 · 错误描述 · 技术 / API / 法规文档 · 函数名\">专业术语 · 产品名 · 错误描述 · 技术 / API / 法规文档 · 函数名</span></small></div>\n<div class=\"cd\" id=\"retrieval-2\"><div class=\"cd-h\"><span class=\"ic\">DENSE</span></div><small><span class=\"i18n-text\" data-i18n-en=\"Encode the Query and documents as embeddings, then use\" data-i18n-zh=\"Query 与文档编码为 Embedding，\">Query 与文档编码为 Embedding，</span><strong><span class=\"i18n-text\" data-i18n-en=\"vector similarity\" data-i18n-zh=\"向量相似度\">向量相似度</span></strong><span class=\"i18n-text\" data-i18n-en=\"to find semantically similar content.\" data-i18n-zh=\"找语义接近内容。\">找语义接近内容。</span></small><div class=\"lb\"><span class=\"i18n-text\" data-i18n-en=\"Suitable for\" data-i18n-zh=\"适合\">适合</span></div><small><span class=\"i18n-text\" data-i18n-en=\"natural-language Q&amp;A · colloquial phrasing · synonyms · users unfamiliar with terminology · cross-language queries\" data-i18n-zh=\"自然语言问答 · 口语化 · 同义词 · 用户不懂术语 · 跨语言\">自然语言问答 · 口语化 · 同义词 · 用户不懂术语 · 跨语言</span></small></div>\n<div class=\"cd\" id=\"retrieval-3\"><div class=\"cd-h\"><span class=\"ic\">GRAPH</span></div><small><span class=\"i18n-text\" data-i18n-en=\"Instead of searching for “which text looks most similar,”\" data-i18n-zh=\"不搜“哪段文字最像”，而是\">不搜“哪段文字最像”，而是</span><strong><span class=\"i18n-text\" data-i18n-en=\"traverse entity relationships\" data-i18n-zh=\"沿实体关系\">沿实体关系</span></strong><span class=\"i18n-text\" data-i18n-en=\"to find the answer. Neo4j / SPARQL / Property Graph.\" data-i18n-zh=\"找答案。Neo4j / SPARQL / Property Graph。\">找答案。Neo4j / SPARQL / Property Graph。</span></small><div class=\"lb\"><span class=\"i18n-text\" data-i18n-en=\"Suitable for\" data-i18n-zh=\"适合\">适合</span></div><small><span class=\"i18n-text\" data-i18n-en=\"BOM · ERP/PLM · org structures · dependencies · multi-hop reasoning · impact analysis\" data-i18n-zh=\"BOM · ERP/PLM · 组织结构 · 依赖 · 多跳推理 · 影响分析\">BOM · ERP/PLM · 组织结构 · 依赖 · 多跳推理 · 影响分析</span></small></div>\n<div class=\"cd\" id=\"retrieval-4\"><div class=\"cd-h\"><span class=\"ic\">META</span></div><small><span class=\"i18n-text\" data-i18n-en=\"It does not understand the answer itself; it is responsible for\" data-i18n-zh=\"本身不理解答案，负责\">本身不理解答案，负责</span><strong><span class=\"i18n-text\" data-i18n-en=\"narrowing the search space first\" data-i18n-zh=\"先缩小搜索范围\">先缩小搜索范围</span></strong>。</small><div class=\"lb\"><span class=\"i18n-text\" data-i18n-en=\"Fields\" data-i18n-zh=\"字段\">字段</span></div><small><span class=\"i18n-text\" data-i18n-en=\"tenant · role · country · language · doc type · version · effective date · confidentiality level\" data-i18n-zh=\"tenant · role · country · language · doc type · version · effective date · 密级\">tenant · role · country · language · doc type · version · effective date · 密级</span></small></div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"tsc rv interp-matrix\"><table id=\"comparison\">\n<thead><tr><th><span class=\"i18n-text\" data-i18n-en=\"Capability\" data-i18n-zh=\"能力\">能力</span></th><th><span class=\"i18n-text\" data-i18n-en=\"Principle\" data-i18n-zh=\"原理\">原理</span></th><th><span class=\"i18n-text\" data-i18n-en=\"Strengths\" data-i18n-zh=\"优势\">优势</span></th><th><span class=\"i18n-text\" data-i18n-en=\"Limitations / Traps\" data-i18n-zh=\"局限 / 陷阱\">局限 / 陷阱</span></th></tr></thead>\n<tbody>\n<tr><td><b>Exact</b></td><td><span class=\"i18n-text\" data-i18n-en=\"Deterministic field matching\" data-i18n-zh=\"字段确定性匹配\">字段确定性匹配</span></td><td><span class=\"i18n-text\" data-i18n-en=\"Fast, stable, and explainable\" data-i18n-zh=\"快、稳定、可解释\">快、稳定、可解释</span></td><td><span class=\"i18n-text\" data-i18n-en=\"Does not understand paraphrases or synonyms; “exact” matching usually still requires normalization (E4307 / E-4307 / Error E 4307 → uppercase, remove spaces, normalize hyphens, alias mapping)\" data-i18n-zh=\"不懂改写与同义；“精确”通常也需要规范化（E4307 / E-4307 / Error E 4307 → uppercase、去空格、连字符、alias）\">不懂改写与同义；“精确”通常也需要规范化（E4307 / E-4307 / Error E 4307 → uppercase、去空格、连字符、alias）</span></td></tr>\n<tr><td><b>BM25</b></td><td><span class=\"i18n-text\" data-i18n-en=\"Lexical matching + relevance ranking\" data-i18n-zh=\"词法匹配 + 相关性排序\">词法匹配 + 相关性排序</span></td><td><span class=\"i18n-text\" data-i18n-en=\"Fast, cheap, explainable, and sensitive to rare terms\" data-i18n-zh=\"快、便宜、可解释、对稀有词敏感\">快、便宜、可解释、对稀有词敏感</span></td><td><span class=\"i18n-text\" data-i18n-en=\"Does not understand semantics; “How can I get my money back?” vs “Refund and reimbursement policy” may have weak recall when lexical overlap is low;\" data-i18n-zh=\"不理解语义；“How can I get my money back?” vs “Refund and reimbursement policy” 词重合少则召回差；\">不理解语义；“How can I get my money back?” vs “Refund and reimbursement policy” 词重合少则召回差；</span><mark><span class=\"i18n-text\" data-i18n-en=\"not a primary-key lookup\" data-i18n-zh=\"不是主键查询\">不是主键查询</span></mark></td></tr>\n<tr><td><b>Dense</b></td><td><span class=\"i18n-text\" data-i18n-en=\"Embedding vector similarity\" data-i18n-zh=\"Embedding 向量相似度\">Embedding 向量相似度</span></td><td><span class=\"i18n-text\" data-i18n-en=\"Handles paraphrases and finds semantically similar content with different wording\" data-i18n-zh=\"处理改写、发现词面不同但语义相近的内容\">处理改写、发现词面不同但语义相近的内容</span></td><td><span class=\"i18n-text\" data-i18n-en=\"Unstable for identifiers / version numbers;\" data-i18n-zh=\"对编号 / 版本号不稳；\">对编号 / 版本号不稳；</span><mark><span class=\"i18n-text\" data-i18n-en=\"cancel subscription and renew subscription are topically similar but semantically opposite in action\" data-i18n-zh=\"cancel subscription 与 renew subscription 主题相近但动作相反\">cancel subscription 与 renew subscription 主题相近但动作相反</span></mark><span class=\"i18n-text\" data-i18n-en=\"; changing the embedding model requires rebuilding the index\" data-i18n-zh=\"；换模型需重建索引\">；换模型需重建索引</span></td></tr>\n<tr><td><b>Graph</b></td><td><span class=\"i18n-text\" data-i18n-en=\"Entity-relation traversal\" data-i18n-zh=\"实体关系遍历\">实体关系遍历</span></td><td><span class=\"i18n-text\" data-i18n-en=\"Multi-hop and impact analysis: Supplier A → Material X → Product Y\" data-i18n-zh=\"多跳与影响分析：Supplier A → Material X → Product Y\">多跳与影响分析：Supplier A → Material X → Product Y</span></td><td><span class=\"i18n-text\" data-i18n-en=\"Requires entity/relation construction first; entity disambiguation and updates are costly\" data-i18n-zh=\"需先建实体与关系；实体消歧与更新成本高\">需先建实体与关系；实体消歧与更新成本高</span></td></tr>\n<tr><td><b>Metadata</b></td><td><span class=\"i18n-text\" data-i18n-en=\"Attribute filtering\" data-i18n-zh=\"属性过滤\">属性过滤</span></td><td><span class=\"i18n-text\" data-i18n-en=\"Reduces irrelevant recall, prevents stale-version contamination, isolates tenants, and improves latency/cost\" data-i18n-zh=\"降无关召回、防旧版本污染、多租户隔离、改善延迟成本\">降无关召回、防旧版本污染、多租户隔离、改善延迟成本</span></td><td><span class=\"i18n-text\" data-i18n-en=\"Overly strict relevance filters can hurt recall; tenant and ACL constraints must never be relaxed to improve recall\" data-i18n-zh=\"相关性过滤过严会漏召回；Tenant / ACL 授权约束不能为召回率让步\">相关性过滤过严会漏召回；Tenant / ACL 授权约束不能为召回率让步</span></td></tr>\n</tbody>\n</table></div>\n<div class=\"bfs-canvas rv\" id=\"authorization\">\n<div class=\"bfs-head\">\n<div>\n<span class=\"bfs-tag\"><span class=\"bfs-tag-dot\"></span>FIG.2.1</span>\n<h2 class=\"bfs-title\">元数据过滤优先：先授权，再语义</h2>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"bfs-body\">\n<div class=\"bfs-grid bfs-g4\"><div class=\"bfs-card bfs-blue\">\n<div class=\"bfs-strip\"></div>\n<div class=\"bfs-card-head\"><span class=\"bfs-stage-pill\">STEP 1</span></div>\n<h2 class=\"bfs-card-title\"><span class=\"i18n-text\" data-i18n-en=\"User: What is the German refund policy for 2026?\" data-i18n-zh=\"用户：2026 年德国退款政策？\">用户：2026 年德国退款政策？</span></h2></div><div class=\"bfs-card bfs-teal\">\n<div class=\"bfs-strip\"></div>\n<div class=\"bfs-card-head\"><span class=\"bfs-stage-pill\">STEP 2</span></div>\n<h2 class=\"bfs-card-title\">country = Germany</h2><div class=\"bfs-card-desc\">valid_year = 2026<br/>document_type = policy</div></div><div class=\"bfs-card bfs-amber\">\n<div class=\"bfs-strip\"></div>\n<div class=\"bfs-card-head\"><span class=\"bfs-stage-pill\">STEP 3</span></div>\n<h2 class=\"bfs-card-title\">BM25 / Dense</h2><div class=\"bfs-card-desc\"><span class=\"i18n-text\" data-i18n-en=\"Retrieve only within the authorized candidate space\" data-i18n-zh=\"在授权候选空间内检索\">在授权候选空间内检索</span></div></div><div class=\"bfs-card bfs-emerald\">\n<div class=\"bfs-strip\"></div>\n<div class=\"bfs-card-head\"><span class=\"bfs-stage-pill\">STEP 4</span></div>\n<h2 class=\"bfs-card-title\">Answer</h2></div></div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"co must rv interp-callout interp-engineering\" id=\"remember\"><span class=\"co-t\"><span class=\"i18n-text\" data-i18n-en=\"Must Remember ×3\" data-i18n-zh=\"必背 ×3\">必背 ×3</span></span>\n<p class=\"say\">Exact retrieval is best for identifiers, but it usually requires field-aware indexing and normalization.</p>\n<p class=\"say\">BM25 handles lexical relevance; it is strong for terminology but weaker for paraphrases.</p>\n<p class=\"say\">Dense retrieval handles meaning, but semantic similarity is not the same as factual or operational equivalence.</p>\n</div>\n<div class=\"co note rv interp-callout interp-engineering\" id=\"principle\"><span class=\"co-t\"><span class=\"i18n-text\" data-i18n-en=\"Key Principle\" data-i18n-zh=\"关键原则\">关键原则</span></span><p><strong>Authorization before semantic similarity.</strong><span class=\"i18n-text\" data-i18n-en=\" Unauthorized documents must not enter the model context.\" data-i18n-zh=\" 未经授权的文档不应进入模型上下文。\"> 未经授权的文档不应进入模型上下文。</span></p></div>\n</section>\n<!-- ======================= CH3 ======================= -->\n<aside class=\"co note\" id=\"verification-02-20260928\"><span class=\"co-t\">2026-09-28 · <span class=\"i18n-text\" data-i18n-en=\"Verification boundaries\" data-i18n-zh=\"验证边界\">验证边界</span></span><p><span class=\"i18n-text\" data-i18n-en=\"Exact normalization must preserve business identity, and ACLs cannot be relaxed for recall. Dense retrieval performance depends on the domain and model; GraphRAG also supports global questions through community summaries.\" data-i18n-zh=\"Exact 规范化必须保留业务身份差异；ACL 不可为 Recall 放宽。Dense 的相对表现依赖数据域与模型；GraphRAG 还可利用社区摘要回答全局问题。\">Exact 规范化必须保留业务身份差异；ACL 不可为 Recall 放宽。Dense 的相对表现依赖数据域与模型；GraphRAG 还可利用社区摘要回答全局问题。</span></p><p><a href=\"https://arxiv.org/abs/2104.08663\">BEIR</a></p></aside>\n</main>"